                <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Apex University of Technology Examination &amp; Academic Management System</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold">1. Portal Access &amp; Responsibilities</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">By logging in to the Apex Examination Portal, users agree to maintain the confidentiality of their credentials. Any unauthorized access, session spoofing, or attempts to tamper with marks or student records will result in disciplinary action under University Disciplinary Regulations.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. Examination Form Submission</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">Students must verify all elective and core subject selections before final submission. Forms submitted past the official closing date will attract late processing charges as notified by the Controller of Examinations.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Marksheet &amp; Certification Validity</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">Downloaded digital marksheets and Admit Cards are valid official academic documents when accompanied by a valid University Photo Identity Card. Results are declared subject to post-publication scrutiny and official validation.</p>
